<title>USA: NYSE Unavailables.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailables.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said Wednesday that Huntingdon Life and Buenos Aires Embotelladora SA were unavailable for trading.</p>
<p>JLG Industries and Alpharma were unavailable for news.</p>
